          "y": 223,
          "name": "Review Section Title 1",
          "fill": "#FFFFFF",
          "content": "市场需求",
          "textAlignVertical": "middle",
          "fontFamily": "Urbanist",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "600"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "m4Ha4",
          "x": 803,
          "y": 248,
          "name": "Review Section Content 1",
          "fill": "#A8B6CF",
          "content": "• 市场需求持续增长，尤其在中小企业服务领域\n• 主要是品类间 A、B 两类产品，服务差异化体现在智能化协同和数据可视化\n• 用户痛点集中在「信息分散、响应慢、缺乏有效跟踪」",
          "lineHeight": 1.6,
          "fontFamily": "Urbanist",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
